# Bounty Radar MCP

This is an mcp-server repository for Bounty Radar MCP development.

## Project structure

- `src/` -- TypeScript HTTP server
- `test/` -- Offline vitest suite
- `package.json` -- npm package manifest

## Conventions

- Use conventional commits (feat:, fix:, chore:, docs:)
- Bump the version in package.json in your PR; CI tags and publishes it
- Keep mcp-tools.json in sync with the registered tools
- HTTP transport, not stdio. Bazaar cannot call stdio.
- No hardcoded credentials, drive-letter paths, or wallet provisioning
